  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Repo Map for DSH",
      "text": "> A compact, regex-based repository orientation map. No language server, no type resolution, no call\n> graph. For precise navigation use `dsh-code-intel`; for full contents use `dsh-repomix`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "```bash\nnode bin/dsh-repo-map.mjs . --json --output map.json\nnode bin/dsh-repo-map.mjs . --max-files 300\n```\n\nIn DSH:\n\n```text\nUse repo_map on this repository.\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Limits",
      "text": "- Regex heuristics, not a parser\n- Top-level symbols only\n- No methods/call graph/references/types\n- No network"
    },
    {
      "section": "Tests",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm test\n```"
    },
